# LF everywhere, enforced from the first commit.
# Why: this repo is authored on Windows but verified on macOS/Linux CI.
# CRLF breaks shell scripts on macOS runners, and SwiftLint's experimental
# Windows support requires Unix line endings in every linted file.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.swift text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.p8 binary
